# rule.always.externalize.tactics.into_skills

the PARENT; go to a specialization:

| you are about to | reach for |
|---|---|
| write a repeated sequence as a runnable artifact | `rule.always.enskill-the-tactics-you-discover` |
| finish by hand after a skill call | `rule.always.entool-the-skills-you-touch` |
| lay a sequence of judgments | 🗿 a route (see enskill) |

a loop: discover a repeat → ENSKILL → notice leftover brain work → ENTOOL.

claim: a multi-step action becomes an idempotent skill in `.agent/repo=.this/role=*/skills/`. cues: multiple steps · hard to discover · chained commands · you will do it again. test: *would i want a button for this?*

blocker: a tactic repeated and not externalized.
